NOTICE for magpie-digital-pet
=============================

This product includes software developed as part of the "digital-pet" project
(https://github.com/jcendal/digital-pet), originally published as the npm
package @jcendal/opencode-digital-pet 0.18.0:

  - lib/upstream/index.js is the unmodified dist bundle of
    @jcendal/opencode-digital-pet@0.18.0 (Apache License 2.0).
  - The Digimon catalog (650 entries), evolution routes (2606), combat stats,
    SQLite schema/migrations and all game logic come from that bundle.
  - Original authors: Jorge Cendal (jcendal), Sergio Bugallo (sbugallo).
    Sprites in the upstream TUI derive from sundeth/omnipet and Tortoiseshel's
    Full Color Digimon Dot Sprites; this port ships no sprite assets.

What this repository adds on top: a magpie gateway middleware adapter
(pet.middleware.js, lib/pet.adapter.mjs), a settings panel (ui/panel.html) and
a CLI (cli/pet-cli.mjs) that drive the upstream engine through its plugin
factory. The engine itself is used as-is.

